Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat(semantics): prototype pure-einsum Program
 correspondence

Lower checked bare UID products and term-local contractions into existing typed Expr and a single-defined-target Program. Prove collection equals the independent canonical global-fiber formula via output/contracted valuation equivalence. Reuse Program.collect_relabel; no production DSL or Eval edits.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
